                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.00/826: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Liberia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Carter</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-06-09T17:00:00-04:00">June 9, 1930—5
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>58. National City Bank requests full text of Liberian Department of State
                    Communication Number 286 D of June 4. Please cable for possible
                    transmission.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
